---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyLegionOrProject AND whenNotPaused AND whenSaleNotCanceled AND whenSaleNotEnded
    q_guard --> q_mark: guards pass
    q_mark --> q_set_end: hasEnded = true
    q_set_end --> q_set_refund: endTime = block.timestamp
    q_set_refund --> q_emit: refundEndTime = block.timestamp + refundPeriodSeconds
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleEnded()

    note right of q_mark
        INV-001: sale can only be ended once (hasEnded flag)
        INV-002: refund period starts from when sale ends
        INV-003: either Legion or project can end the sale
    end note
